# Privacy Policy for Safiri Passenger

**Last updated:** September 25, 2026

This Privacy Policy describes how Safiri Passenger ("we", "us", or "Safiri") collects, uses, and shares information when you use our mobile application, Safiri Passenger.

Information We Collect

* **Personal Information:** Name, email address, phone number, and profile photo when provided.
* **Location Data:** Precise GPS location to identify your pickup location, display nearby drivers, enable trip tracking, and provide transportation services.
* **Device Information:** Device model, operating system, unique device identifiers, IP address, and related technical information.
* **Usage Data:** Trip history, ride requests, destinations, app activity, and interactions with the application.
* **Transaction Information:** Information related to your rides, fares, payments, or other transactions made through the app, where applicable.

How We Use Your Information

We use your information to:

* Operate and provide the Safiri Passenger service.
* Connect passengers with available drivers.
* Identify pickup and destination locations.
* Enable real-time trip tracking.
* Calculate and display applicable fares.
* Provide trip notifications and service updates.
* Maintain your trip history.
* Improve the performance, reliability, and security of the application.
* Respond to customer support requests.
* Help ensure passenger and driver safety.
* Comply with applicable legal and regulatory obligations.

Location Data

Safiri Passenger uses your location to provide core transportation features, including identifying your pickup location, finding nearby drivers, and tracking your trip.

Location access may be requested while you are using the application. You can disable location permissions through your device settings, but certain Safiri features, including requesting and tracking rides, may not function correctly without location access.

Sharing of Information

We do not sell your personal information.

We may share relevant information with:

* **Drivers:** Information necessary to provide and manage your requested trip, such as your name, pickup location, destination, and relevant trip details.
* **Service Providers:** Third-party providers that support services such as hosting, maps, location services, notifications, analytics, and payment processing where applicable.
* **Legal Authorities:** Information when required by applicable law, regulation, legal process, or a valid governmental request.
* **Safety and Security Partners:** Information where reasonably necessary to investigate, prevent, or address fraud, security incidents, or safety-related matters.

Data Retention

We retain your information for as long as necessary to provide Safiri services, maintain your account and trip history, comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, enforce our agreements, and protect our legitimate business interests.

When information is no longer required, we may delete or anonymize it in accordance with applicable requirements.

Your Rights

You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information, subject to applicable legal requirements and limitations.

For privacy-related requests, contact us at:

[support@mymobisolutions.com](mailto:support@mymobisolutions.com)

Children's Privacy

Safiri Passenger is not intended for users under 18 years of age. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 18.

Security

We use reasonable technical and organizational safeguards designed to protect your information against unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, or destruction.

However, no method of electronic transmission or storage can be guaranteed to be completely secure.

Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected by updating the "Last updated" date at the top of this policy.

We encourage users to review this Privacy Policy periodically.

Contact

For questions, requests, or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy or your personal information, please contact:

[support@mymobisolutions.com](mailto:support@mymobisolutions.com)
